中国的穷人多了，\n月薪3500的年轻人算不算穷人？\n没退休金的农村老人算不算穷人？\n小区保安保洁算不算穷人？\n\n所以你要么别领，\n领了就说明你就是不如穷人，\n这钱就是给这种人发的！","raw_text":{"text":"领低保就一定就一定要活的像穷人？\n\n不，当然不是。\n\n——领低保的生活都不如穷人——\n\n理论上什么人领低保？说白了就是——没了这个钱，全家都活不下去了\n\n一般上而言：是既没钱，还没劳动能力，要么是老的走不动，要么是残了\n\n如果只是以贫穷为判定，\n那中国的穷人多了，\n月薪3500的年轻人算不算穷人？\n没退休金的农村老人算不算穷人？\n小区保安保洁算不算穷人？\n\n所以你要么别领，\n领了就说明你就是不如穷人，\n这钱就是给这种人发的！","display_text_range":[0,214],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[150,173],"id":"2117513114543607808","display":"pic.x.com/TKCgyQdMG7","original":"https://t.co/TKCgyQdMG7","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2117513122265374967/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"btcmos","url":"https://x.com/btcmos","id":"1865722200185307136","followers":61793,"following":28944,"likes":126239,"media_count":969,"statuses":9027,"name":"香港老雷","description":"美股老韭｜BTC玩家｜加密合约｜AI资讯|AI投资｜数据整理｜WEIBO：香港老雷","raw_description":{"text":"美股老韭｜BTC玩家｜加密合约｜AI资讯|AI投资｜数据整理｜WEIBO：香港老雷","facets":[]},"location":"Japan","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1888127766488625152/Fiba7f5J_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Dec 08 11:37:14 +0000 2024","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":15,"reposts":0,"likes":18,"bookmarks":0,"quotes":0,"embed_card":"summary_large_image","created_at":"Tue Nov 03 07:04:04 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1793689444,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":2432,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"zh","replying_to":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"photo","id":"2117513114543607808","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWLq9WeaUAAk7Im.jpg?name=orig","width":1154,"height":185}],"photos":[{"type":"photo","id":"2117513114543607808","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWLq9WeaUAAk7Im.jpg?name=orig","width":1154,"height":185}]},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2117496496388206661","id":"2117496496388206661","text":"天塌了：柬埔寨电诈 把清华毕业生骗了\n\n真是日了狗了！\n清华毕业也斗不过柬埔寨狗推。\n目前这孩子已经失联，家属正在找！\n\n失联学生施某某，2026年清华大学化学系本科毕业，于今年9月前往英国入读UCL（伦敦大学学院）研究生。\n\n诈骗分子以被抽到移民调查为理由，\n让他要做存款证明提供给移民局。\n然后他就转了45万给人家\n\n清华大学本科的毕业生，\n英国的留学生\n\n都扛不住柬埔寨诈骗的套路，\n\n你说牛逼不牛逼？真是防不胜防！","raw_text":{"text":"天塌了：柬埔寨电诈 把清华毕业生骗了\n\n真是日了狗了！\n清华毕业也斗不过柬埔寨狗推。\n目前这孩子已经失联，家属正在找！\n\n失联学生施某某，2026年清华大学化学系本科毕业，于今年9月前往英国入读UCL（伦敦大学学院）研究生。\n\n诈骗分子以被抽到移民调查为理由，\n让他要做存款证明提供给移民局。\n然后他就转了45万给人家\n\n清华大学本科的毕业生，\n英国的留学生\n\n都扛不住柬埔寨诈骗的套路，\n\n你说牛逼不牛逼？真是防不胜防！","display_text_range":[0,211],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[147,170],"id":"2117496466679930880","display":"pic.x.com/ouqOSGcNXP","original":"https://t.co/ouqOSGcNXP","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2117496496388206661/photo/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[147,170],"id":"2117496477203525632","display":"pic.x.com/ouqOSGcNXP","original":"https://t.co/ouqOSGcNXP","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2117496496388206661/photo/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[147,170],"id":"2117496486720409600","display":"pic.x.com/ouqOSGcNXP","original":"https://t.co/ouqOSGcNXP","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2117496496388206661/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"btcmos","url":"https://x.com/btcmos","id":"1865722200185307136","followers":61793,"following":28944,"likes":126239,"media_count":969,"statuses":9027,"name":"香港老雷","description":"美股老韭｜BTC玩家｜加密合约｜AI资讯|AI投资｜数据整理｜WEIBO：香港老雷","raw_description":{"text":"美股老韭｜BTC玩家｜加密合约｜AI资讯|AI投资｜数据整理｜WEIBO：香港老雷","facets":[]},"location":"Japan","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1888127766488625152/Fiba7f5J_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Dec 08 11:37:14 +0000 2024","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":43,"reposts":7,"likes":85,"bookmarks":20,"quotes":1,"embed_card":"summary_large_image","created_at":"Tue Nov 03 05:58:00 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1793685480,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":13170,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"zh","replying_